ning. Iroh is well known for rarely using lightening but constantly redirecting it in a similar manner. In fact he refuses to teach Zuko how to make lightening but readily teaches him how to redirect it.</p><p>Thank You for the time! Can someone please confirm this since it has been bothering me for awhile!</p><p>I also apologize for any spelling errors!</p>",
